rong> Levels designed to test your spatial logic and survival skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization and Rewards:</strong> Earn achievements by solving difficult puzzles to unlock visual upgrades and customize your avatar.  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADVENTURE TIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/4876344926f3c9625ac6032c6743fcb7.poster.avif?t=1776099861\" width=620 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/4876344926f3c9625ac6032c6743fcb7.webm?t=1776099861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/4876344926f3c9625ac6032c6743fcb7.mp4?t=1776099861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE CAMPAIGN: ASYMMETRIC BOSS FIGHTS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a fully narrated, single-player story campaign where you fight Queens and Kings of the past. Do you dare to challenge Genghis Khan, outsmart King Solomon or terrify Ivan the Terrible?  <br>Be warned: <strong>they do not play by the rules.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Historical leaders act as boss fights with unique and unfair abilities, from infinite piece respawns to randomized traps and poisoned boards. You cannot win by playing standard chess. Use whatever it takes to your advantage, slip past heavy defenses and assassinate the King or the Queen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect the unexpected after the very first move.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/edc